    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. One thing I'm struggling with is the nature of the entries themselves. They are very small, almost negligible amounts, but they seem to appear almost randomly—sometimes in clusters, sometimes just as single, odd entries out of nowhere. It feels like they're just... popping up in the margins. How should I approach looking for a specific pattern if the entries seem to lack a clear, predictable logic?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
