      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Since the entries lack obvious logic, shift your focus from the *amount* to the *metadata* surrounding the transaction. Group the anomalies by date, employee ID, or the specific time of day they were entered into the system. This can reveal underlying behavioral patterns, such as specific individuals or times that correlate with the isolated entries. Look for subtle consistencies, like always being entered on a Friday afternoon, regardless of the amount.",
